# Large datasets
# Keep source code, docs, config, and README tracked
# These directories are excluded from version control
# because they can be very large and are typically generated or local data
# Dataset folders are intentionally ignored
# to avoid committing training and test data
# Note: source files under src/, docs/, and config files are still tracked
# unless explicitly ignored here.
dataset/raw/
dataset/classification/
yolov8n-cls.pt
